# User Interface Field Specifications

This document defines the required **Form Fields**, **Dropdown Options**, and **Validation Rules** for the frontend UI implementation of the Facility Management modules.

---

## 1. Branch Management UI

### Screen: "Manage Branches"
**Action:** Add / Edit Branch

| Field Label | Input Type | Validation / Constraints | Helper Text |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Branch Name** | Text Input | Required, Min 3 chars | e.g., "Computer Science & Engineering" |
| **Branch Code** | Text Input | Required, Uppercase, Unique | e.g., "CSE" |
| **Total Seats** | Number Input | Required, Min 1 | Total intake capacity |
| **HOD Name** | Text Input | Optional | Head of Department Name |

---

## 2. Hostel Management UI

### Screen: "Create Hostel Building"
**Action:** Add New Hostel

| Field Label | Input Type | Validation / Constraints | Helper Text |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Hostel Name** | Text Input | Required | e.g., "Krishna Boys Hostel" |
| **Hostel Type** | Dropdown | Required | Options: `Boys`, `Girls` |
| **Total Capacity** | Number Input | Required | Total beds in the building |
| **Warden Name** | Text Input | Optional | |
| **Contact Number** | Phone Input | Optional, 10 digits | Warden's contact |

### Screen: "Add Room"
**Action:** Add Room to Block

| Field Label | Input Type | Validation / Constraints | Helper Text |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Select Hostel** | Dropdown | Required | Lists existing hostels |
| **Select Block** | Dropdown | Required | Lists blocks in selected hostel |
| **Room Number** | Text Input | Required | e.g., "101", "A-202" |
| **Room Type** | Dropdown | Required | `AC`, `Non-AC` |
| **Sharing Type** | Dropdown | Required | `2-Sharing`, `4-Sharing`, `8-Sharing` |
| **Room Capacity** | Number Input | Auto-filled based on Sharing Type | |

