## 3. Transport Management UI

### Screen: "Fleet Management"
**Action:** Add Vehicle

| Field Label | Input Type | Validation / Constraints | Helper Text |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Bus Number** | Text Input | Required, License Plate Format | e.g., "TS09 UA 1234" |
| **Vehicle Type** | Dropdown | Required | `Bus`, `Minivan` |
| **Seating Capacity** | Number Input | Required, Max 60 | |
| **Driver Name** | Text Input | Required | |
| **Driver Phone** | Phone Input | Required | |

### Screen: "Route Configuration"
**Action:** Define Route

| Field Label | Input Type | Validation / Constraints | Helper Text |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Route Name** | Text Input | Required | e.g., "Route 5 - City Center" |
| **Assigned Vehicle** | Dropdown | Required | Lists available buses |
| **Cost (Annual)** | Currency | Required | e.g., 25000 |
| **Start Time** | Time Picker | Required | e.g., 07:30 AM |

### Screen: "Manage Stops" (Repeater Field)
**Parent:** Route Configuration

| Field Label | Input Type | Details |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Stop Name** | Text Input | e.g., "Main Circle" |
| **Pickup Time** | Time Picker | e.g., 07:45 AM |
| **Drop Time** | Time Picker | e.g., 04:30 PM |
| **Sequence** | Number | Order of the stop (1, 2, 3...) |

