## 4. Student Allocation UI (The "Counseling" Screen)

### Screen: "Update Admission & Facilities"
**Context:** Admin viewing a Student Profile

#### Section A: Core Admission
| Field Label | Input Type | Logic |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Allotted Branch** | Dropdown | Lists all Branches. Shows Available Seats in bracket. e.g. "CSE (2 left)" |
| **Admission Status** | Read-Only | e.g., "Seat Allotted" |

#### Section B: Facility Selector
**Toggle Switch:** `[ ] Opt for Facility`

**If Toggle ON -> Select Type:**
*   ( ) **Hostel**
*   ( ) **Transport**

**If "Hostel" Selected:**
| Field Label | Input Type | Data Source |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Hostel Type** | Dropdown | `SHARING_4`, `SHARING_8` |
| **Select Building** | Dropdown | Filtered by Student Gender (e.g., Only Boys Hostels) |
| **Select Room** | (V2 Advanced) | Shows Available Rooms |

**If "Transport" Selected:**
| Field Label | Input Type | Data Source |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Select Route** | Dropdown | Lists Routes. Shows "Filled/Capacity" e.g "Route A (35/40)" |
| **Pickup Point** | Dropdown | Lists Stops for the selected route |

#### Section C: Fee Summary (Auto-Calulated)
| Label | Value |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Tuition Fee** | ₹ 1,25,000 |
| **Facility Fee** | ₹ {Dynamic based on Selection} |
| **Total Payable** | ₹ {Sum} |
